<title>NETHERLANDS: Vendex has NLG 400 mln Vedior gain.</title>
<headline>Vendex has NLG 400 mln Vedior gain.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Retailer Vendex International NV said on Tuesday it had made a book profit of more than 400 million guilders on the flotation of a minority stake in its temporary labour and cleaning unit Vedior last week.</p>
</text>
